Notice of modifications (Apache-2.0 section 4(b) / Foursquare NOTICE):
  The data was clipped to the bounding box 139.6997,35.6518,139.7217,35.6698
  (around Aoyama Gakuin University, Aoyama Campus, Tokyo), converted from
  GeoParquet to GeoJSON, and reduced to the following properties:
  id, names.primary, English name, basic_category, taxonomy.primary,
  taxonomy.hierarchy, confidence (rounded to 3 decimals), operating_status,
  first address (freeform), first website, and sources (dataset, license).
  No values were otherwise edited.

Background map tiles in the web map: 地理院タイル (GSI Tiles), Geospatial
Information Authority of Japan. Tiles are loaded at view time and are not
redistributed in this repository.
